# 任务打卡系统 · Apache 规则（用 Apache 的面板自动生效；Nginx 请用「伪静态-直接粘贴.txt」）
<FilesMatch "^\.(env|user\.ini)$">
    Require all denied
</FilesMatch>

RewriteEngine On
RewriteRule ^(app|deploy)(/|$) - [R=404,L]
RewriteRule ^storage/uploads/.*\.(php|phtml|phar)$ - [R=404,L]
RewriteCond %{REQUEST_URI} !^/storage/uploads/
RewriteRule ^storage(/|$) - [R=404,L]
RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} !-f
RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} !-d
RewriteRule ^ index.php [L]
